{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-one-commission-settings",
    "name": "One Portal · Commission Settings · /apiv2/commission_settings",
    "description": "Portal（`one/api`）自助佣金设置 6 个接口契约测试。\n\n对齐 `api/internal/handler/routes.go`（prefix `/apiv2/commission_settings` + `AuthMiddleware`）。\n\n| 方法 | 路径 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| GET | `/overview` | 总览（Profile + 可分配额度 + 下级摘要） |\n| GET | `/chain` | 返佣链路（仅直系下级） |\n| GET | `/sub_affiliates` | 直属下级佣金列表 |\n| POST | `/sub_affiliates` | 批量设置下级佣金（立即生效） |\n| GET | `/history` | 设置历史分页 |\n| GET | `/history/:setting_id` | 历史详情 + timeline |\n\n**鉴权**：`Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`（JWT；中间件可能在响应 `token` 字段刷新）。\n\n**本地**：`apiBase=http://127.0.0.1:8081`（`api/etc/main.toml` Port=8081）\n\n**testnet**：`apiBase=https://affiliates-testnet.zoomex.com`\n\n**运行**：\n- `npm run pm:one-commission-settings:local`\n- `npm run pm:one-commission-settings:testnet`（需 private 环境填入 accessToken）",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "apiBase",
      "value": "https://affiliates-testnet.zoomex.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "submitShareRate",
      "value": "10.0"
    },
    {
      "key": "targetAffiliationId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "settingId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "_origShareRate",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "_canAllocate",
      "value": "false"
    },
    {
      "key": "_hasDirectSub",
      "value": "false"
    },
    {
      "key": "_submitOk",
      "value": "false"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const token = (pm.environment.get('accessToken') || pm.collectionVariables.get('accessToken') || '').trim();",
          "if (!token) {",
          "  throw new Error('缺少 accessToken：请在环境中填入 Portal JWT（登录后 Authorization Bearer，或 /login 返回的 result）');",
          "}",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Authorization', value: 'Bearer ' + token });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Accept', value: 'application/json, text/plain, */*' });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Accept-Language', value: 'zh-CN,zh;q=0.9' });"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const ct = (pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '').toLowerCase();",
          "const text = pm.response.text() || '';",
          "if (pm.response.code === 401) {",
          "  const name = (pm.info && pm.info.requestName) || '';",
          "  if (/无\\s*Token|无\\s*auth|no\\s*auth/i.test(name)) return;",
          "  pm.test('鉴权失败（HTTP 401，请更新 accessToken）', () => {",
          "    pm.expect.fail('Unauthorized');",
          "  });",
          "  return;",
          "}",
          "if (ct.includes('text/html') || text.trimStart().startsWith('<!')) {",
          "  pm.test('响应应为 JSON API', () => pm.expect.fail('got HTML'));",
          "  return;",
          "}",
          "try {",
          "  const body = pm.response.json();",
          "  if (body && typeof body.token === 'string' && body.token.length > 0) {",
          "    pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.token);",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.token);",
          "  }",
          "} catch (e) { /* ignore */ }"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 Setup",
      "description": "拉取 overview / sub_affiliates，缓存 targetAffiliationId、可分配态与原始比例（供写接口恢复）。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "S01 GET /overview 缓存入口态",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('ret_code=0', () => pm.expect(body.ret_code).to.eql(0));",
                  "const r = body.result || {};",
                  "pm.test('Overview 关键字段', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(r).to.include.keys(",
                  "    'affiliation_id', 'affiliation_name', 'agent_type', 'level',",
                  "    'self_serve_enabled', 'allocatable_rate', 'allocatable_rate_e6',",
                  "    'has_direct_sub', 'can_allocate', 'sub_affiliate_count'",
                  "  );",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('_canAllocate', String(!!r.can_allocate));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('_hasDirectSub', String(!!r.has_direct_sub));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('affiliationId', String(r.affiliation_id || ''));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{apiBase}}/apiv2/commission_settings/overview"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "S02 GET /sub_affiliates 缓存 target + 原比例",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('ret_code=0', () => pm.expect(body.ret_code).to.eql(0));",
                  "const r = body.result || {};",
                  "pm.test('List 分页结构', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(r).to.include.keys('list', 'page', 'page_size', 'total', 'allocatable_rate_e6');",
                  "  pm.expect(r.list).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});",
                  "if (r.list && r.list.length > 0) {",
                  "  const item = r.list[0];",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('targetAffiliationId', String(item.target_affiliation_id));",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('_origShareRate', String(item.current_rate || ''));",
                  "  if (item.setting_id) pm.collectionVariables.set('settingId', String(item.setting_id));",
                  "  pm.test('已缓存 targetAffiliationId', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.collectionVariables.get('targetAffiliationId')).to.match(/^[0-9]+$/);",
                  "  });",
                  "} else {",
                  "  pm.test('无直属下级 — 写接口正例将跳过', () => pm.expect(r.total).to.eql(0));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiBase}}/apiv2/commission_settings/sub_affiliates?page=1&page_size=20",
              "host": [
                "{{apiBase}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "apiv2",
                "commission_settings",
                "sub_affiliates"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "page_size",
                  "value": "20"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
